OL,3,GNEWSAI had no heating or electricity
OL,4,Afor more than two years - now I have a
OL,5,Anew island home
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor the past-two-and-a-half years, some
OL,8,Fbasic home comforts have been hard to
OL,9,Fcome by for Ruari Morgan.
OL,11,FA fire in the backup generator of his
OL,12,Fold stone cottage on Rathlin Island
OL,13,Fleft him without electricity, heating
OL,14,For hot water.
OL,16,FNow he's enjoying the simple pleasures
OL,17,Fof being able to come home and put the
OL,18,Fkettle on or have a shower after he
OL,19,Fmoved in to a new social home two weeks
OL,20,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
