OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI had no heating or electricity
OL,4,Afor more than two years - now I have a
OL,5,Anew island home
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe development of 10 social houses is
OL,8,Fthe first on the island for more than a
OL,9,Fdecade and it is hoped it will allow
OL,10,Fthe unique community to sustain its
OL,11,Fpopulation and provide a boost to its
OL,12,Feconomy.
